---
title: Styled states
---
stateDiagram-v2
    accTitle: The states of a door
    accDescr {
        A door opens and closes,
        and it can lock.
    }
    direction LR
    %% a comment
    classDef warn fill:#f96,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    classDef calm fill:#9cf
    [*] --> Closed
    Closed --> Open : open
    Open --> Closed : close
    Closed --> Locked:::warn : lock
    Locked --> Closed : unlock
    class Open calm
    style Closed stroke:#c00,stroke-width:3px
    state Locked {
        direction TB
        Bolted --> Chained
    }
